# An unbounded 'T' stays a wildcard: any value is accepted (backwards compatible).
weave store_any shard T with x as ref to T, v as T into void:
    set essence of x is v

weave main into int:
    var n as int is 0
    calling store_any with (sigil of n), 7
    var f as float is 0.0
    calling store_any with (sigil of f), 1.5
    if n == 7 and f == 1.5:
        return 0
    return 1
